OL,3,AHealey to ask EU finance ministers to
OL,4,Alet UK into Made in Europe scheme
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe chancellor is to warn the European
OL,7,FUnion (EU) not to lock the UK out of
OL,8,Fits scheme to protect industries from
OL,9,Funfair Chinese competition.
OL,11,FJohn Healey will push for closer UK-EU
OL,12,Fpartnerships on tech, defence, and
OL,13,Fmanufacturing at a meeting of EU
OL,14,Ffinance ministers in Dublin on Friday.
OL,16,FBut he will call on the EU to design
OL,17,Fits "Made in Europe" programme in a way
OL,18,Fthat deepens ties with the UK "rather
OL,19,Fthan erecting new barriers", Treasury
OL,20,Fsources told the BBC.
OL,23,APub: 17-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
