OL,3,AHealey to ask EU finance ministers to
OL,4,Alet UK into Made in Europe scheme
OL,5,
OL,6,FOfficials said Healey will tell
OL,7,FEuropean finance ministers it is
OL,8,Fimportant to "learn lessons" after
OL,9,Ftalks collapsed last year for Britain
OL,10,Fto join an EU defence loans scheme.
